# Unblessed: sqlite Host failures a Script catches (#467); first blessing awaits human review.
# `sqlite busy` from change and begin, a constraint with its kind, and
# `too many rows` are caught like any Script error. A failed call still
# enrolls its Grant, so the Segment commits; a begin that fails opens no scope.
# A constraint kind outside the list becomes host error.
